setPerpex.t.sol
├── when caller does not have the {ADMIN_ROLE}
│   └── it should revert with {AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller has {ADMIN_ROLE}
    ├── when the new perpex contract address is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with {POOL__ZERO_ADDRESS} error
    └── when the new perpex contract address is not the zero address
        ├── it should update the perpex contract address
        ├── it should revoke the {PERPEX_ROLE} to the previous perpex contract address
        ├── it should grant the {PERPEX_ROLE} to the new perpex contract address
        └── it should emit the {PerpexUpdated} event
                